libstdc++ 13 <chrono>: `12h' (chrono_literals) is fixed
(cpp11_user_defined_literal_call_forms), as is format:1422 (see
test_format.desc).  Remaining: <format>'s basic_format_arg::_M_visit
(format:3124), the same drop as test_format.desc.  (bits/unique_ptr.h:93,
default_delete::operator() for an incomplete type, is not reported as a
system-header function and is not odr-used.)  g++ 13 accepts this
program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
